    text: "Customers can board bus shuttles at the following station locations: \r\n•\tWheat Ridge-Ward Road – Gate B \r\n•\tArvada Ridge – Gate B \r\n•\tOlde Town Arvada – Gate A \r\n•\t60th & Sheridan-Arvada Gold Strike – Gate A \r\n•\tClear Creek-Federal – Gate C \r\n\n\r\nAffected stops:\r\nClear Creek - Federal Station Track 1 (#34530)\r\n60th & Sheridan - Arvada Gold Strike Station Track 1 (#34526)\r\nOlde Town Arvada W-Bound (#34542)\r\nArvada Ridge Station Track 1 (#34520)\r\nWheat Ridge - Ward Station Track 1 (#34510)"
